<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Speaker Course Submission Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .logo-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo-text {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .contact-info {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .notes-section {
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .notes-section h2 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .notes-list {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .notes-list li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-section {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .form-section h2 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .form-item {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .form-item label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-item input[type="text"], .form-item textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .compliance-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .compliance-table th, .compliance-table td {
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .compliance-table th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .initial-check {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-section">
      <div style="font-size: 30pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">T</div>
      <div class="logo-text">Temple University<br>Kornberg School of Dentistry</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div>Office of the Continuing Education</div>
      <div>5213 North Broad Street<br>Philadelphia, PA 19140</div>
      <div>phone {{ contact_phone }}<br>fax {{ contact_fax }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Speaker Course Submission Form</h2>

  <div class="notes-section">
    <h2>NOTES:</h2>
    <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>A course may be cancelled one week before the course date if there are not enough attendees.</li>
      <li>All lectures will be given live via Zoom until further notice.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 20px;">In order to have all necessary information regarding your presentation for the purpose of publication and advertisement we request the following information to be emailed to <span data-field="submission_email">{{ submission_email }}</span>.</p>
    <ol style="font-size: 11pt; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Speaker Name, Address, Cell Number, Email</li>
      <li>Lecture Title</li>
      <li>Lecture Synopsis/Course Description</li>
      <li>Lecture Learning Goals (At least 3-5)</li>
      <li>One paragraph bio sketch</li>
      <li>Current CV for our files</li>
      <li>Honorarium (if applicable)</li>
      <li>Course Date</li>
      <li>Course Time (1 hour, 3 hour, 6 hour, other):</li>
      <li>Portrait photo for lecture flyer (.jpg format)</li>
    </ol>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 20px;">Do you grant permission to Temple University Kornberg School of Dentistry to use your photo, bio and other course information provided on this form for distribution via the course flyer, advertisement flyer and on our Continuing Education website? <span data-field="permission_yes_no">{{ permission_yes_no }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2>Based on new ADA CERP compliance criteria, please read and initial after each statement.</h2>
    <table class="compliance-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 70%;">Statement</th>
          <th class="initial-check">Initial</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Speaker must ensure that continuing dental education activities promote improvements in oral healthcare and not a specific drug, device, service or technique of a commercial entity.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Speaker must disclose any financial interests with companies, products, technology, etc. And if none, disclose such to attendees.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Speaker must support clinical recommendations with references to scientific literature wherever possible and further disclose risks/benefits.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Speaker must attest that images used in CE activities have not been falsified to Mis-represent treatment outcomes.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Speaker will provide contact information (phone, fax, email) to participants for follow up with questions and/or concerns.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Hands-on participation courses must have a ratio of at least one instructor per fifteen participants.</td>
          <td class="initial-check">Initial</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>